  "statement": "The middle panel contains 59 individually rayed star figures and two roundels with human faces. The upper roundel has an ochre crescent and encircling text. The lower has a tilted face, blue blocks, and encircling text. A second reader counted the stars independently on the same scan and confirmed the faint rays of the two lower-right stars separately from stains. Native centers are approximate and stars are ordered from top to bottom. The visual inventory was frozen before extracting the locus headers. No transcription words or prior annotation were consulted. The scan shows 24 adjacent writing groups, one to the left of its star and 23 to the right. The label-only locus tags give 24 candidate Ls lines, but no positional metadata establishes which numbered locus belongs to any given star. No numeric-to-spatial correspondence has been inferred from their matching counts. The two Cc running texts are not standalone label loci.",
